WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.072 --> 00:00:01.534
(shushing)

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.554
(baby babbling)

00:00:03.554 --> 00:00:04.675
- I don't know why she won't sleep.

00:00:04.675 --> 00:00:07.037
I mean, she's fed, she's
got a fresh diaper,

00:00:07.037 --> 00:00:08.652
she's swaddled.

00:00:08.652 --> 00:00:10.996
- Maybe it's 'cause
we're making eye contact.

00:00:10.996 --> 00:00:11.751
- What?

00:00:11.751 --> 00:00:13.125
- Well, I read that if
you make eye contact,

00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:16.882
it keeps them engaged and awake.

00:00:16.882 --> 00:00:18.541
(baby cooing)

00:00:23.497 --> 00:00:24.420
Is she asleep?

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.076
- I don't know, I can't see her.

00:00:28.229 --> 00:00:29.378
What is that?

00:00:29.378 --> 00:00:31.990
- This is a glove full of beans.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.488
You lay it on their back and it,

00:00:33.488 --> 00:00:34.784
you know, makes it feel like someone's

00:00:34.784 --> 00:00:37.012
touching them while they're sleeping.

00:00:37.012 --> 00:00:38.475
- Okay, where did you hear about that?

00:00:38.475 --> 00:00:39.368
And don't say.

00:00:39.368 --> 00:00:40.877
- [In unison] The internet.

00:00:40.877 --> 00:00:42.323
- Right.

00:00:42.323 --> 00:00:44.302
Let's get out of here.

00:00:44.302 --> 00:00:46.611
(blow dryer blowing)

00:00:49.003 --> 00:00:50.988
(vacuum cleaner roaring)

00:00:52.509 --> 00:00:54.773
(dryer running)

